# Never in an image (IR369): env files hold deployment values, which reach the containers through the environment at
# run time (container design §4). Next.js also copies a loaded .env / .env.production into the standalone output.
**/.env*
# Local test runs: the E2E sign-in state holds signed-in sessions; reports and coverage are not needed to build.
e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
